{"id":86,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","transliteration":"Wal-samāi wal-ṭāriq","translation":"By the sky and the night comer -"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā ṭ-ṭāriq","translation":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","transliteration":"An-najmu th-thāqib","translation":"It is the piercing star -"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍۢ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌۭ","transliteration":"In kullu nafsil-lammā ʿalayhā ḥāfiẓ","translation":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","transliteration":"Falyanẓuri l-insānu mimma khuliq","translation":"So let man observe from what he was created."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍۢ دَافِقٍۢ","transliteration":"Khuliqa mim-māin dāfiq","translation":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","transliteration":"Yakhruju min bayni ṣ-ṣul'bi wal-tarāib","translation":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌۭ","transliteration":"Innahu ʿalā rajʿihi laqādir","translation":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able."},{"number":9,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","transliteration":"Yawma tub'lā s-sarāir","translation":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍۢ وَلَا نَاصِرٍۢ","transliteration":"Famā lahu min quwwatiw-walā nāṣir","translation":"Then man will have no power or any helper."},{"number":11,"arabicText":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","transliteration":"Wal-samāi dhāti r-rajʿ","translation":"By the sky which returns [rain]"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","transliteration":"Wal-arḍi dhāti ṣ-ṣadʿ","translation":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,"},{"number":13,"arabicText":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌۭ فَصْلٌۭ","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlun faṣl","translation":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","transliteration":"Wamā huwa bil-hazl","translation":"And it is not amusement."},{"number":15,"arabicText":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًۭا","transliteration":"Innahum yakīdūna kaydā","translation":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًۭا","transliteration":"Wa-akīdu kaydā","translation":"But I am planning a plan."},{"number":17,"arabicText":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","transliteration":"Famahhili l-kāfirīna amhil'hum ruwaydā","translation":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile."}]}